Package: bayesfoRest
Type: Package
Title: Forest Plots for Bayesian Meta Analyses in R
Description: bayesfoRest creates forest plots for Bayesian meta-analyses
    using various modelling backends including brms, MetaStan, bayesmeta,
    rstanarm, rstan, cmdstanr, and R2jags. Supports both common-effects and
    random-effects models with customizable visualization options.
Version: 0.0.0.9000
